<description>&lt;p&gt;Stephen Miller is confronting his first crisis as White House chief of staff while the United States is deploying drones to strike ELN guerrilla elements operating inside Venezuela, adding external military pressure. Venezuela and Colombia have agreed to collaborate on border security after a series of kidnappings that link cross-border crime to the Venezuelan crisis. At COP31, world leaders are expressing conflicting priorities, reflecting heightened international attention to the region. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQVUJGTmU0OUlnNHg1QVdVRUZsQVZkMWZ2MzhqRFBIMzFxOUNpN3AtUUl6a1lSZnNnZ3hpbUJUeFNqLS1mNlJtVHJtRk1UZFhNNmU1X0ZkS083UEF1S3F1TUJHS0tOaF9PalpmVEJMZjg2blpsRHVHeU05enVwakI2cFc0LXhmM3loeWotMkNyVGxsZEh5VVhxeDNZQzJtdnRlMGZaMGxiYXp3V0JnZWFwT2ZzYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOanFOSUk5RG52VjUxZm5QcWhXb0lSUHRHWlhGUlVvQk9qSkl4eXVxV0tIX1I0U0U2d1RMNGJoNFFzcncxTmFpNU5NZnIzdlB0cTR5cTFLejhxM2FXZTdicDVHZmI0amlIZG5nMnFLTkxYZzM5aDFQWjVHaS1sSlAtUDhwLU43OGhYNFdjSkZIRTh2X1lMc2JabWxnWF9vSk93a1ZyZ2VwLXFXd3oxSzByT3Nn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPNngtTTdNNWh2YXdsTUNwRVo3NHZIY3JqcU1zaVBZdGdiODBGMmtaNTRDN1JWbmlpNERtc1l2UzB3VGdwZnlJQktOWTFJdl9qX3RxUW5vWl9RWFJjRE5ZTzNhQnM1eTFUaEdTV2JwODF1dlRVRVBPSkkzdmhDdE0yUV93b1ZPdWpNazhxbFBWY0FEdmt6VUh0Ri1iQzc1YnNMOVA2TnIyYUhIaG1VeDdGejBaVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPbGxKM3R5T09iSmZXc3lMMVB5NGJ1c05VYkY4V3ZMWDJPTTIzdDBTNUpmN2VDZVpVWTJibkVjVE5xN0tmYmM3a1JUTy1sdlhCNm5TcGFaSEpiTlhIWVR0WDY3dWZsTVM0em80NFVOdnlKdGsyWDV4R2ZaZTkzSFNjUDBZZ3doYl91RW0tMjViYkw3bF